.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
# Ignore all fetched/generated data. Regeneration steps live in skill/data-process.md;
# what the data actually is lives in doc/data.md.
# Leading slash matters: a bare `data/` also matches src/data/, which is SOURCE CODE
# (the crawlers) and must stay tracked.
/data/
# dashboard/data.js is committed so the dashboard works from a fresh clone
# (data/ contents are ignored, so they can't be regenerated after cloning)

# Standalone replays: ~3 MB each with the payload inlined, only useful for emailing ONE
# race as a single file. NOT needed to view a replay — dashboard/replay.html (committed,
# ~50 KB) now opens straight off disk and shows every race in data/replay/. Generated,
# and git keeps every revision, so they stay out.
dashboard/replay_*.html
dashboard/replays/

# Local Claude Code settings (worktrees, per-machine overrides)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
